    <node id="&quot;SIGAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SIGAA is a computer system used by students to manage their academic records and personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by students at UnB to evaluate their professors and courses before the start of each semester."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used to manage academic activities, including internships, at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is the student portal used for course enrollment and other academic-related activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is the system where students register their internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sigaa is a system used by the University of Brasilia for academic management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sistema Eletrônico de Informação da Universidade de Brasília (SEI), an electronic system used to manage academic processes"&lt;SEP&gt;"Sistema de Administração de Atividades Aca-dêmicas (SIGAA), a system used for academic administration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SIGAA system is a digital platform used by the University of Brasília (UnB) for various administrative tasks, including registering internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c404738092a3fab90cd0e5ca0d0d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
