    <node id="&quot;DISCIPLINAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Disciplines are academic subjects that make up a student's curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Internships or practicums are components of the curriculum where students gain practical experience in their field."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AÇÕES DE EXTENSÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Actions of extension refer to community outreach activities that can be part of a student's curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONOGRAFIAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Monographies are extensive research projects written by students, often as part of their graduation requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRABALHOS DE CONCLUSÃO DE CURSO (TCC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thesis or Final Project is a comprehensive research project that students must complete to graduate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATIVIDADES COMPLEMENTARES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Complementary Activities refer to additional, non-obligatory components of the curriculum designed to enrich the student's academic experience.&lt;SEP&gt;"Complementary activities refer to any activity that does not correspond to a required component but can contribute to student development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE ABERTA DO BRASIL (UAB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Universidade Aberta do Brasil (UAB) is a distance learning program offered by the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade Aberta do Brasil (UAB) is a distance learning university, providing access to higher education for students across the country."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENSINO SUPERIOR (IFES)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ensino Superior (IFES) refers to Federal Institutions of Higher Education, which offer distance learning courses like UAB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is the university where the stages are being managed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia (UnB) is the educational institution where the study plan is being followed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia (UnB) is the institution where the document is provided, offering various opportunities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia (UnB) is the organization mentioned throughout the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia is an institution where students complete their studies and participate in internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia is the institution in which this document was created."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution where students can complete mandatory and optional stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution where the given process takes place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is an educational organization where a student will be completing their internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília (UnB) is the higher education institution where a student needs help with their internship registration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília is a higher education institution where the stage is being managed.")( "entity"&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília is hosting an event where students make decisions about their advisors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasília is the geographical location where these events are taking place."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a city and the capital of the Federal District in Brazil, where the University of Brasília is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a university that offers both on-campus and distance learning programs."&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Brasilia where the document was created and related information about the process is discussed.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5219cf0817cbb82473514dd9f7028dc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
