    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB) CURRICULAR STRUCTURE (CURRÍCULO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The UnB Curricular Structure refers to the structure of a course as outlined in its curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
