    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a contract that outlines the terms of an internship or practicum for students."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a document that outlines the terms and conditions for a student's internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCE is a document signed by the student and representatives from UnB and the company or institution where the internship will take place, outlining the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCE is a document signed by the student and representatives from UnB and the company or institution where the internship will take place."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a contract that outlines the terms and conditions of an internship, including start and end dates, compensation, and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a legal document that outlines the terms and conditions of an internship."</data>
