      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPPORT.OFFICE.COM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"support.office.com is an online support resource for issues related to Office 365."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MÓDULO DE ESTÁGIO DO SIGAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The module of internships in the SIGAA system is used for managing student internships at the University of Brasilia."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMO ADITIVO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Termo Aditivo is an additional agreement or contract related to a student's internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELATÓRIO DE ATIVIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Relatório de Atividades is a report detailing the activities completed during a student's internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO CURRICULAR OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mandatory Curricular Stage is a required component of the course that must be completed for graduation. It usually does not provide a company stipend or transportation voucher, but may offer remuneration from the company if a formal agreement is in place with the University of Brasília (UnB)."&lt;SEP&gt;An obligatory stage of the curriculum where the student must participate to graduate.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEI FEDERAL DE ESTÁGIO Nº 11.788/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Federal Law 11.788/2008 regulates both mandatory and optional stages for students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lei Federal de Estágio nº 11.788/2008 is a federal law that regulates internships in Brazil."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPRESA/ESCOLA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Companies or schools are involved in mandatory and optional stages for students."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVENIO FORMALIZADO COM A UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A formal agreement between the company/school and the University of Brasília is required for some types of mandatory or optional stages."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TCE (TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a legal document signed by all parties involved in the stage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEGURO CONTRA ACIDENTES PESSOAIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INSURANCE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Personal accident insurance is required for mandatory and optional stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seguro contra acidentes pessoais refers to insurance against personal accidents required for internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLANOS DE ATIVIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PLAN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plans of activities are required for both mandatory and optional stages to ensure they align with the student's course objectives."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The professor or academic advisor oversees the student during their stage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISCIPLINAS OU OUTRAS ATIVIDADES ACADÊMICAS DESENVOLVIDAS PELO(A) DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACADEMIC ACTIVITIES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic activities developed by the student, such as classes or other academic requirements, should not conflict with the stage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARGA HORÁRIA DIÁRIA E SEMANAL NÃO PODE ULTRAPASSAR 6H E 30H&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"WORK HOURS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The daily and weekly work hours for a stage should not exceed 6 hours and 30 hours, except in cases where the course plan allows for exceptional circumstances."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXCEPCIONALIDADE PREVISTA NA LEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EXCEPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The law allows for exceptions to the daily and weekly work hour limits in certain cases."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATRÍCULA NO COMPONENTE CURRICULAR DE ESTÁGIO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"REGISTRATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Students must be registered for the mandatory stage course component to participate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGAA (SISTEMA INTEGRADO DE GESTÃO ACADÊMICA DA UNB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SYSTEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The SIGAA system is used for registering stages at the University of Brasília."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PPCS DOS CURSOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CURRICULUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Course plans specify the requirements and expectations for mandatory and optional stages."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIRETORIA DE ACOMPANHAMENTO E INTEGRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA (DAIA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIRECCIÓN DE ACOMPAÑAMIENTO Y INTEGRACIÓN ACADÉMICA (DAIA) is a department within the University of Brasília responsible for academic follow-up and integration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DAIA is a department within the University of Brasília responsible for academic accompaniment and integration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is a department of the University of Brasília (UnB). It plays a role in providing academic support and guidance to students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is a department of the University of Brasília (UnB)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is a department within the Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG), responsible for academic guidance and integration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is a unit within the Universidade de Brasília (UnB), responsible for academic monitoring and integration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is the department of academic guidance and integration at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretória de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica is an administrative body at the University of Brasília responsible for student support and academic integration."&lt;SEP&gt;A department at the University responsible for academic guidance and integration.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CESG is an event, possibly a coordination meeting or series of meetings related to internships or student placements."&lt;SEP&gt;"COORDENACIÓN DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG) is a subdivision within the University of Brasília responsible for coordinating internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is a department of the University of Brasília (UnB), responsible for coordinating internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is a subunit within the Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA), responsible for managing stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is the division responsible for managing internships at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios is an administrative body at the University of Brasília responsible for managing stages."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The student is the individual who will start the process of registering for an internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRÉ-CADASTRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pre-Cadastro is an event where students start the process of registering their internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTRAPRESTAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Contraprestação refers to payment or compensation, such as scholarships and transportation allowances."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNPJ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CNPJ stands for Cadastro Nacional de Pessoas Jurídicas (National Registry of Legal Entities), which is a Brazilian tax identification number for businesses and non-profit organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"CNPJ stands for Código Nacional de Identificação de Pessoa Jurídica e is a Brazilian federal tax number for legal entities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágio is the internship or work experience required for a student's degree program within the University of Brasília."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIPO DE ORIENTADOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This entity represents a decision-making process where students select their professor or advisor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type of Advisor refers to a category to determine if the advisor is an internal professor or a voluntary one."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOCENTE INTERNO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON, ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Docente Interno refers to a permanent faculty member who serves as an advisor for students' internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"This entity represents a type of professor or advisor that is an employee of the University of Brasília."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOCENTE VOLUNTÁRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON, ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Docente Voluntário is a non-permanent educator who volunteers to serve as an advisor for students' internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON, ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Supervisor refers to the professional responsible for supervising and guiding the student during their work experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"The supervisor(a) is responsible for overseeing and guiding the student's internship activities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
