      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica - Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is a division within the DAIA, specifically responsible for managing internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA/COORDENAÇÃO OU PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Secretaria/coordenação or professor/advisor is the person the student should send their termination of internship document to."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE RESCISÃO OU CANCELAMENTO DO ESTÁGIO NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Termo de Rescisão ou Cancelamento do Estágio não Obrigatório is the document a student may need to send if they decide to terminate their internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS DE GRADUAÇÃO (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">A part of the University that works on coordinating graduate internships.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECANATO DE ENSINO E GRADUAÇÃO (DEG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">An educational management division of the University.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLANOS POLÍTICOS PEDAGÓGICOS DOS CURSOS (PPC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">The curriculum plans for courses, which include internships as a required component.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEI DE ESTÁGIO Nº 11.788/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
      <data key="d1">A Brazilian law that regulates internships.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVÊNIO FORMAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONTRACT"</data>
      <data key="d1">A formal agreement between the University and an external institution or company, for instance regarding internships.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A student is a participant in the university, who completes courses and undertakes internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CURRICULAR OBLIGATORY INTERNSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
